  "row_count": 6,
  "notes": {
    "raw": "Phase change: 610 K, calculated boiling point for $H_{2}SO_{4}(l) = H_{2}SO_{4}(g)$ ; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 13.9$ kcal/mol. Experimental vapor pressure equals 1 atm at 553 K. The vapor at this temperature is 76.6 mol pct $SO_{3}(g)$ . \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 7 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: & \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 1 9. 1 5 3 + 4 6. 5 2 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 0 8 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ & \\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 1 9. 1 5 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 2 3. 2 6 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 0. 0 8 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 7. 7 4 9 \\end{array}\n$$\nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 7 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = - 2 0 9. 6 6 9 - 5. 9 3 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 2 1. 6 7 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 1 1 6. 9 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta \\mathrm{Gr} ^ {\\circ} = - 2 0 9. 6 6 9 + 5. 9 3 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} - 2 1. 6 7 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 5 8. 4 7 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} + 9 1. 4 9 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\end{array}\n$$\nSource: Data from Chase (17). ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "Phase change: 610 K, calculated boiling point for $H_{2}SO_{4}(l) = H_{2}SO_{4}(g)$ ; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 13.9$ kcal/mol. Experimental vapor pressure equals 1 atm at 553 K. The vapor at this temperature is 76.6 mol pct $SO_{3}(g)$ .",
      "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations:",
      "$$",
      "\\begin{array}{r l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 7 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: & \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 1 9. 1 5 3 + 4 6. 5 2 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 0 8 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ & \\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 1 9. 1 5 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 2 3. 2 6 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 0. 0 8 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 7. 7 4 9 \\end{array}",
      "$$",
      "Reaction equations (kcal/mol):",
